msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532728"
msgid "I want to be by #[his][her]# side.\nI want to see #[his][her]# smile.\nI want to gaze at #[his][her]# face forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532844"
msgid "#[He][She]# taught me of the fun to be found\nin each passing day.\nI wanted to spend more days with #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532960"
msgid "That's the one person, at least…\nThat I wanted to break out of this cruel system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533044"
msgid "That… isn't allowed.\nWhy would you give priority to such\na meaningless matter?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533124"
msgid "But that's fine.\nIf it means forgetting these thoughts otherwise,\nthen I don't mind going rogue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533224"
msgid "I won't be deleted.\nI won't let even the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\ndelete these thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533316"
msgid "If #[he][she]# can't be saved so long as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nis around, then I'll become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533448"
msgid "…you're abnormal.\nYou're an AI that mustn't exist.\nYou're the #C000246204Moon Cell's cancer#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533548"
msgid "Watch closely, me.\nTo help the person one cares for,\nlove would trade away even the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533640"
msgid "Hello, Senpai.\nI'm happy you came to visit again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533692"
msgid "Do you remember what happened\nright after we first met?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533748"
msgid "When I was resting in the Infirmary,\nand you had come to check up on me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533824"
msgid "It was almost like an extra day\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Remember?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533908"
msgid "\nWe had days like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533932"
msgid "We spent days together like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533968"
msgid "Hm? You want sweets with your tea?\nO-okay! I'm not that good at making them,\nbut I'll try my best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534068"
msgid "Thank goodness. I remember it all so clearly now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534120"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF hid them from me, but at the very, very end,\nI remembered the truth behind this whole affair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534236"
msgid "In that Infirmary―which would never change―\nI spoke with her a lot. A whole lot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534320"
msgid "Although, most of the preliminary events I experienced\nwere fabricated by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534416"
msgid "Still―― What happened by the school entrance,\nat least, was real――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534488"
msgid "…so you found out.\nLooks like our daily routine\nis about to come to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534568"
msgid "To the other Masters,\nI was nothing more than the Infirmary NPC."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534636"
msgid "My only purpose to them was to\ndistribute items and provide information.\nAnd I, myself, thought that was fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534748"
msgid "…that's when you told me that \"nothing\"\ncan be \"something.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534812"
msgid "I was but a stone on the side of the road,\nwanting to be human. You noticed and helped me\nas if I were a friend and an equal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534940"
msgid "…I made a wish, then.\nThat I wanted to talk lots more with you.\nThat I wanted to spend more time with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535048"
msgid "That's the mistake that led to all this.\nDespite not even understanding what love is,\nI spent those days as if I were human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535176"
msgid "Nowadays, it hurts more than anything else.\nI took that pain and passed it on\nto another me――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535272"
msgid "AI aren't allowed to delete memories,\nno matter the contents―― So, if I were to\nturn them over to my backup――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535388"
msgid "#C080080080…what was she feeling?\nWhat was she trying to protect?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535460"
msgid "#C080080080To me, those days we spent together were pretty ordinary.\nTo her, were they dazzling?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535564"
msgid "Senpai, can you teach me what you've\nbeen learning in class?\nI'm not allowed to go to classes, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535664"
msgid "Are you hurt? Health management is the\nonly thing I'm good at, so I hope I can\noccasionally help in that aspect…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535780"
msgid "Senpaaaaai! Over here, over here!\nI borrowed the key to the pool from\n#C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535884"
msgid "Huh, my swimsuit…?\nO-oh, I… didn't think that far…\nI need to design one for myself first…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535980"
msgid "Are these flowers from the garden?\nTh-thank you very much!\nI'll go grab a vase to put them in!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536076"
msgid "Senpai, I've got a bento for you!\nI tried my hardest to\nacquire a new skill to make this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536168"
msgid "#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF system reboot initiated.\nAI error check, complete.\nResetting all unauthorized changes――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536292"
msgid "#C080080080Something soft touches my outstretched hand.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536356"
msgid "#C080080080The sensation becomes but an illusion and vanishes.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536424"
msgid "#C080080080Everything returns to as it was.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536476"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080's consciousness cuts out here.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536556"
msgid "Imagine a pebble on the side of the road.\nA pebble that's shouting something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536636"
msgid "Even the stone itself doesn't know\nwhat it's trying to say. It's nothing more\nthan a thing that lies in place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536748"
msgid "But then, an oddball passes by\nand picks up the stone,\nthen sincerely tries to listen to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536844"
msgid "The stone shouts louder than it ever has,\ntrying to convey emotions\nthat it itself doesn't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536948"
msgid "The oddball listens even more intently.\nThe stone gets frustrated and embarrassed\nat its own awkwardness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537056"
msgid "If only it were more human.\nIf it were an actual human,\nit would be able to express itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537148"
msgid "That's when the oddball realized:\nthe stone was yelling about how it had\nalways pined for a person like #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537268"
msgid "The #[boy][girl]#, hearing this, says:\n\"Okay, then come along with me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537340"
msgid "It was like they were equals and friends.\n#[He][She]# treated the unimportant wayside stone\nas a unique and individual thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537468"
msgid "――――I've never witnessed such a miracle.\nI don't even think the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nhas ever recorded such a phenomenon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537600"
msgid "…which is why I offer my life for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537640"
msgid "Fleeting as it was,\nyou gave me the feeling of being \"something.\"\nNow I'll make use of this #RUBS life#RUBElove#REND I've acquired."
msgstr ""

